      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1>MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW</h1>\\n\\n<p></p>\\n<p></p>\\n<p></p>\\n\\n<hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\">\\n\\n<p></p>\\n<p></p>\\n<p></p>\\n\\n<h2><span data-ic=\\\"model-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Load Diffusion Model</h2>\\n\\n<p></p>\\n\\n<p>\\n  <span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\">\\n    <a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnsize\\\">12.2 GB</span></a>\\n  </span>&nbsp;\\n</p>\\n\\n<p></p>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\">Place in: ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/krea2</div>\\n\\n<p></p>\\n<p></p>\\n<p></p>\\n\\n<p>Create the <code>krea2</code> folder if it does not exist.</p>\\n\\n<p></p>\\n\\n<p>\\n  <span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\">\\n    <a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/tree/main/diffusion_models\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">More versions</a>\\n  </span>&nbsp;\\n</p>\\n\\n<p></p>\\n\\n<hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\">\\n\\n<p></p>\\n<p></p>\\n<p></p>\\n\\n<h2><span data-ic=\\\"CLIP\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Load CLIP</h2>\\n\\n<p></p>\\n\\n<p>Use <b>either</b> the Heretic INT8 version <b>or</b> the FP8 version below.</p>\\n\\n<p>\\n  <span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\">\\n    <a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/DreamFast/Qwen3-VL-4b-Heretic-ComfyUI/resolve/main/qwen3-vl-4b-heretic_int8.safetensor